---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<Layout
  title="FranchiseVista | Franchise Consulting and Lead Generation in India"
  description="FranchiseVista finds, qualifies and closes franchisees for brands, and helps investors compare franchises across India."
  currentPage="home"
>

<section class="hero hero-home on-dark" aria-labelledby="h1">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="hero-in">
      <span class="eyebrow">Franchise consulting and lead generation</span>
      <h1 id="h1">We find and close franchisees for your brand.</h1>
      <p class="lead">FranchiseVista generates, qualifies and signs franchise investors across India, so your team only speaks to buyers who are ready.</p>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a class="btn btn-gold" href={`${base}for-brands`}>I'm a brand</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href={`${base}find-a-franchise`}>I want to buy a franchise</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="strip" aria-label="Who we work with">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="grid g2">
      <div class="card aud">
        <div class="aud-top">
          <img class="ico" src={`${base}assets/icon_partner.webp`} alt="" width="64" height="64" loading="lazy">
          <h2 style="font-size:24px">For brands</h2>
        </div>
        <p>Appoint franchisees without building a sales team. We find, qualify and take each deal to a signed agreement.</p>
        <a class="tlink" href={`${base}for-brands`}>See how it works for brands <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
      </div>
      <div class="card aud">
        <div class="aud-top">
          <img class="ico" src={`${base}assets/icon_invest.webp`} alt="" width="64" height="64" loading="lazy">
          <h2 style="font-size:24px">For investors</h2>
        </div>
        <p>Compare brands and investment levels, then enquire. One clear conversation, in your own time.</p>
        <a class="tlink" href={`${base}find-a-franchise`}>Browse franchises <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec" aria-labelledby="how-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head center">
      <span class="eyebrow">How it works</span>
      <h2 id="how-h">Six steps from first enquiry to signed agreement</h2>
      <p class="lead">Deals close only after the investor speaks to the brand's team and visits. So we plan for both.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step">
        <span class="step-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
        <img class="ico" src={`${base}assets/icon_find.webp`} alt="" width="64" height="64" loading="lazy">
        <div><h3>Attract</h3><p>We bring the right people to your brand through focused channels.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <span class="step-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
        <img class="ico" src={`${base}assets/icon_research.webp`} alt="" width="64" height="64" loading="lazy">
        <div><h3>Capture and qualify</h3><p>Every enquiry gets a call and a structured check before it moves on.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <span class="step-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
        <img class="ico" src={`${base}assets/icon_consult.webp`} alt="" width="64" height="64" loading="lazy">
        <div><h3>Present</h3><p>We present your offer, terms and model clearly and consistently.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="zone">
        <p class="zone-label">
          <span class="tick"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15" height="15" fill="none" stroke="#0B2D5B" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5"/></svg></span>
          <span>Where deals close: the investor meets your team, then visits.</span>
        </p>
        <div class="step">
          <span class="step-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span>
          <img class="ico" src={`${base}assets/icon_diligence.webp`} alt="" width="64" height="64" loading="lazy">
          <div><h3>Brand conversation</h3><p>The investor speaks with your team. This is where trust is built.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <span class="step-n" aria-hidden="true">5</span>
          <img class="ico" src={`${base}assets/icon_location.webp`} alt="" width="64" height="64" loading="lazy">
          <div><h3>Outlet or site visit</h3><p>The investor sees a working outlet or the planned site.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <span class="step-n" aria-hidden="true">6</span>
        <img class="ico" src={`${base}assets/icon_contracts.webp`} alt="" width="64" height="64" loading="lazy">
        <div><h3>Negotiate and sign</h3><p>We negotiate within your terms and take the deal to a signed agreement.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec bg-panel on-dark" aria-labelledby="chan-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Lead channels</span>
      <h2 id="chan-h">Five ways we bring investors to your brand</h2>
      <p class="lead">We run several channels together, so no single source carries your pipeline.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid g5">
      <div class="chan"><h3>Brand landing page</h3><p>A dedicated page that presents your offer and captures enquiries.</p></div>
      <div class="chan"><h3>Sector listings</h3><p>Your brand listed where investors compare franchises in your category.</p></div>
      <div class="chan"><h3>Targeted campaigns</h3><p>Campaigns aimed at the investor profile you want to reach.</p></div>
      <div class="chan"><h3>WhatsApp and call-back</h3><p>Quick replies and scheduled call-backs while interest is fresh.</p></div>
      <div class="chan"><h3>Partner network</h3><p>Referrals from advisers and networks who work with investors.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec" aria-labelledby="feat-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="car-head">
      <div class="sec-head">
        <span class="eyebrow">Featured brands</span>
        <h2 id="feat-h">See how brands appear to investors</h2>
        <p class="lead">Sample cards show how a listing looks. Figures are indicative and set by each brand.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="car-ctl">
        <button class="car-btn" id="car-prev" type="button" aria-label="Previous brands" disabled>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 5l-7 7 7 7"/></svg>
        </button>
        <button class="car-btn" id="car-next" type="button" aria-label="Next brands">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="car" role="region" aria-label="Featured sample brands" tabindex="0">
      <div class="car-track" id="car-track">
        <article class="card bcard">
          <div class="bc-top">
            <div class="tile" role="img" aria-label="Sample brand logo tile"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="30" height="30" fill="none" stroke="#F5A000" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 9l1.5-5h15L21 9"/><path d="M3 9a3 3 0 0 0 6 0 3 3 0 0 0 6 0 3 3 0 0 0 6 0"/><path d="M5 12v8h14v-8"/><path d="M10 20v-5h4v5"/></svg></div>
            <span class="chip">Food &amp; Beverage</span>
          </div>
          <h3>Sample Brand</h3>
          <dl class="facts"><div><dt>Investment</dt><dd>₹10 – 15 lakh</dd></div><div><dt>Franchise fee</dt><dd>₹2 lakh</dd></div></dl>
          <a class="btn btn-navy btn-sm" href={`${base}franchise/sample-brand`}>Enquire<span class="sr"> about Sample Brand</span></a>
        </article>
        <article class="card bcard">
          <div class="bc-top">
            <div class="tile" role="img" aria-label="Sample brand logo tile"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="30" height="30" fill="none" stroke="#F5A000" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 9l1.5-5h15L21 9"/><path d="M3 9a3 3 0 0 0 6 0 3 3 0 0 0 6 0 3 3 0 0 0 6 0"/><path d="M5 12v8h14v-8"/><path d="M10 20v-5h4v5"/></svg></div>
            <span class="chip">Retail</span>
          </div>
          <h3>Sample Brand</h3>
          <dl class="facts"><div><dt>Investment</dt><dd>₹20 – 30 lakh</dd></div><div><dt>Franchise fee</dt><dd>₹3 lakh</dd></div></dl>
          <a class="btn btn-navy btn-sm" href={`${base}franchise/sample-brand`}>Enquire<span class="sr"> about Sample Brand</span></a>
        </article>
        <article class="card bcard">
          <div class="bc-top">
            <div class="tile" role="img" aria-label="Sample brand logo tile"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="30" height="30" fill="none" stroke="#F5A000" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 9l1.5-5h15L21 9"/><path d="M3 9a3 3 0 0 0 6 0 3 3 0 0 0 6 0 3 3 0 0 0 6 0"/><path d="M5 12v8h14v-8"/><path d="M10 20v-5h4v5"/></svg></div>
            <span class="chip">Education</span>
          </div>
          <h3>Sample Brand</h3>
          <dl class="facts"><div><dt>Investment</dt><dd>₹8 – 12 lakh</dd></div><div><dt>Franchise fee</dt><dd>₹1.5 lakh</dd></div></dl>
          <a class="btn btn-navy btn-sm" href={`${base}franchise/sample-brand`}>Enquire<span class="sr"> about Sample Brand</span></a>
        </article>
        <article class="card bcard">
          <div class="bc-top">
            <div class="tile" role="img" aria-label="Sample brand logo tile"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="30" height="30" fill="none" stroke="#F5A000" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 9l1.5-5h15L21 9"/><path d="M3 9a3 3 0 0 0 6 0 3 3 0 0 0 6 0 3 3 0 0 0 6 0"/><path d="M5 12v8h14v-8"/><path d="M10 20v-5h4v5"/></svg></div>
            <span class="chip">Health &amp; Wellness</span>
          </div>
          <h3>Sample Brand</h3>
          <dl class="facts"><div><dt>Investment</dt><dd>₹25 – 40 lakh</dd></div><div><dt>Franchise fee</dt><dd>₹5 lakh</dd></div></dl>
          <a class="btn btn-navy btn-sm" href={`${base}franchise/sample-brand`}>Enquire<span class="sr"> about Sample Brand</span></a>
        </article>
        <article class="card bcard">
          <div class="bc-top">
            <div class="tile" role="img" aria-label="Sample brand logo tile"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="30" height="30" fill="none" stroke="#F5A000" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 9l1.5-5h15L21 9"/><path d="M3 9a3 3 0 0 0 6 0 3 3 0 0 0 6 0 3 3 0 0 0 6 0"/><path d="M5 12v8h14v-8"/><path d="M10 20v-5h4v5"/></svg></div>
            <span class="chip">Services</span>
          </div>
          <h3>Sample Brand</h3>
          <dl class="facts"><div><dt>Investment</dt><dd>₹5 – 8 lakh</dd></div><div><dt>Franchise fee</dt><dd>₹1 lakh</dd></div></dl>
          <a class="btn btn-navy btn-sm" href={`${base}franchise/sample-brand`}>Enquire<span class="sr"> about Sample Brand</span></a>
        </article>
        <article class="card bcard">
          <div class="bc-top">
            <div class="tile" role="img" aria-label="Sample brand logo tile"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="30" height="30" fill="none" stroke="#F5A000" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 9l1.5-5h15L21 9"/><path d="M3 9a3 3 0 0 0 6 0 3 3 0 0 0 6 0 3 3 0 0 0 6 0"/><path d="M5 12v8h14v-8"/><path d="M10 20v-5h4v5"/></svg></div>
            <span class="chip">Fitness</span>
          </div>
          <h3>Sample Brand</h3>
          <dl class="facts"><div><dt>Investment</dt><dd>₹35 lakh – 1 crore</dd></div><div><dt>Franchise fee</dt><dd>₹7.5 lakh</dd></div></dl>
          <a class="btn btn-navy btn-sm" href={`${base}franchise/sample-brand`}>Enquire<span class="sr"> about Sample Brand</span></a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec bg-soft" aria-labelledby="qual-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="split split-r">
      <div class="stack" style="gap:20px">
        <img class="ico ico-lg" src={`${base}assets/icon_research.webp`} alt="" width="88" height="88" loading="lazy">
        <span class="eyebrow">Our qualification promise</span>
        <h2 id="qual-h">Only qualified candidates reach your brand.</h2>
        <p class="lead">Before any introduction, we check six things on a call. Candidates who don't meet your criteria don't move forward.</p>
        <p class="note">Qualified means checked against your criteria. It is not a promise of success.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid g2" style="gap:16px">
        <div class="card crit">
          <div class="crit-top"><span class="tick"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15" height="15" fill="none" stroke="#0B2D5B" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5"/></svg></span><h3>Investment capacity</h3></div>
          <p>Can they fund the investment level and working capital?</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card crit">
          <div class="crit-top"><span class="tick"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15" height="15" fill="none" stroke="#0B2D5B" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5"/></svg></span><h3>Source of funds</h3></div>
          <p>Is the money clearly sourced and available?</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card crit">
          <div class="crit-top"><span class="tick"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15" height="15" fill="none" stroke="#0B2D5B" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5"/></svg></span><h3>Location and space</h3></div>
          <p>Do they have a suitable site or space in the territory?</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card crit">
          <div class="crit-top"><span class="tick"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15" height="15" fill="none" stroke="#0B2D5B" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5"/></svg></span><h3>Operating intent</h3></div>
          <p>Will they run the outlet themselves or appoint a manager?</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card crit">
          <div class="crit-top"><span class="tick"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15" height="15" fill="none" stroke="#0B2D5B" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5"/></svg></span><h3>Business background</h3></div>
          <p>What experience do they bring to the business?</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card crit">
          <div class="crit-top"><span class="tick"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15" height="15" fill="none" stroke="#0B2D5B" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5"/></svg></span><h3>Start timeline</h3></div>
          <p>When can they realistically begin?</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta" aria-labelledby="cta-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="cta-in">
      <h2 id="cta-h">Find the right franchise. Build your future.</h2>
      <p class="lead">Tell us whether you're a brand or an investor and we'll call you back.</p>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a class="btn btn-gold" href={`${base}contact`}>Talk to us</a>
        <a class="btn btn-wa" href="https://wa.me/919667395517" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Message on WhatsApp</a>
      </div>
      <p class="cta-meta">
        <span>Vikas Gupta</span>
        <a href="tel:+919667395517">+91 96673 95517</a>
        <a href="mailto:franchisevista@growthoriginator.in">franchisevista@growthoriginator.in</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  let slide = 0;
  const track = document.getElementById('car-track');
  const prevBtn = document.getElementById('car-prev');
  const nextBtn = document.getElementById('car-next');

  function updateCarousel() {
    if (!track) return;
    track.className = 'car-track' + (slide > 0 ? ' s' + slide : '');
    if (prevBtn) prevBtn.disabled = slide === 0;
    if (nextBtn) nextBtn.disabled = slide === 2;
  }

  prevBtn?.addEventListener('click', () => { if (slide > 0) { slide--; updateCarousel(); } });
  nextBtn?.addEventListener('click', () => { if (slide < 2) { slide++; updateCarousel(); } });
  updateCarousel();
</script>

</Layout>
